<svelte:head><title>GridUbuntu — Shared energy. Shared possibility.</title><meta name="description" content="GridUbuntu is a Zimbabwean social enterprise developing shared solar storage and intelligent energy management for households and small businesses."/></svelte:head>
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> POWERED BY THE SUN. ROOTED IN UBUNTU.</div><h1>Shared energy.<br/>Shared <em>possibility.</em></h1><p>When we share power, we grow together. We’re making clean, reliable energy more accessible to Zimbabwe’s communities.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/how-it-works">Discover how it works <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/our-mission">Meet GridUbuntu <span>→</span></a></div><div class="hero-note"><span class="tiny-sun">☀</span><span>Local sunshine. Collective strength.<br/><strong>A brighter future for all of us.</strong></span></div></div><div class="hero-visual"><img src="/solar.jpg" alt="Solar panels capturing sunshine for clean energy" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="image-label">THE FUTURE IS<br/><strong>community powered.</strong></div><div class="solar-seal">CLEAN ENERGY<br/><span>✳</span><br/>SHARED POTENTIAL</div><div class="photo-bottom"><span>01 / THE POWER OF TOGETHER</span><span>ZIMBABWE ↗</span></div></div></section>
<div class="principles"><span>One sun. More possibility.</span><span>Shared solar + storage</span><span>Intelligent energy management</span><span>Community at the centre</span></div>
<section class="intro section"><div><div class="eyebrow">THE IDEA IS SIMPLE</div><h2>Good energy goes<br/>further <em>together.</em></h2></div><div><p class="lead">Reliable power should open doors. For the learner studying after sunset. The shopkeeper keeping the lights on. The family building a better tomorrow.</p><p>GridUbuntu brings shared solar generation, battery storage, and intelligent energy management into one community-focused model. More than technology, it’s a way to turn individual resources into collective opportunity.</p><a class="text-link" href="/our-mission">The purpose behind our power ↗</a></div></section>
<section class="system section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">A SMARTER WAY TO SHARE</div><h2>From sunshine<br/>to shared opportunity.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/how-it-works">Explore the system ↗</a></div><div class="process-grid">{#each [['01','Capture','Local solar panels turn everyday sunshine into clean electricity.','☀'],['02','Store','Shared batteries keep energy available beyond the sunny hours.','▤'],['03','Share fairly','An intelligent EMS balances demand and tracks contributions and use.','⇄']] as [n,title,copy,icon]}<article><div class="step-top"><span>{n}</span><span class="step-icon">{icon}</span></div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{copy}</p></article>{/each}</div></section>
<section class="mission-band"><div class="eyebrow">I AM BECAUSE WE ARE.</div><h2>Ubuntu is more than our name.<br/>It’s how we imagine energy.</h2><p>Our social enterprise puts access, fairness, and community wellbeing at the heart of the energy transition.</p><a class="button amber" href="/community">Powering everyday possibility ↗</a><span class="band-sun" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></section>
